{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_10-805j-technology-law-and-the-working-e_syllabus","fact_refs":[3],"question":"How is the grade broken down in 10.805J Technology, Law, and the Working Environment?","answer":"Class Participation is 15%, Writing Assignment is 15%, Midterm is 35%, and Second Exam is 35%."}
