{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_10-805j-technology-law-and-the-working-e_syllabus","fact_refs":[8],"question":"What topics does 10.805J investigate regarding the working environment?","answer":"It covers regulation of toxic substances and processes affecting worker health and safety, the economics of health and safety, labor and anti-discrimination law, worker right-to-know, and workers' compensation."}
